        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for North West Pastoral, West Coast, Eastern Eyre Peninsula, Lower Eyre Peninsula, Mid North, Yorke Peninsula, Mount Lofty Ranges, Kangaroo Island, Riverland, Murraylands, Upper South East and Lower South East forecast districts</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, rain and showers and southwesterly winds are expected during Saturday and Sunday. Areas likely to be affected include the Mount Lofty Ranges, West Coast, Eastern Eyre Peninsula, Yorke Peninsula, Mid North, Murraylands, Upper South East and Lower South East forecast districts and parts of the Lower Eyre Peninsula, Kangaroo Island, Riverland and North West Pastoral forecast districts. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
